Z||000000||stimpy||11-27-2000||11:32 AM||||For all those folks who have been waiting to see the oft-promised pic of my footwell sub install, well, wait no more! Here it is!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=258191&a=1921599&p=34099626&Sequence=5&res=high"> <BR> <BR>For those who don't know, it is a Polk dX10 in a fiberglass and plywood enclosure.  Now, I am not claiming to be some IASCA whizkid, and have no claims on SPL or whatever. That being said, when I cank this lil bastard up, my nose hairs jump to the beat! hehehe...<P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||10
