Z||000018||Seanh||11-28-2000||10:47 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fropuff:<BR><B>I looked in the Crutchfield catalog, and I found an 8" Rockford Punch XLC for $80.  That's not too bad, and it would be a little cheaper at Best Buy.  I also found a Polk dX for $120.  Not bad I guess.  The first thing I'm going to get is a new head unit.  I'm thinking a Pioneer DEH-P77DH.  Anyone have one and are some pictures available of it installed?  Thanks.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I dont have any pictures of the P77DH, but I can tell you Pioneer is one of the best brands you will ever find. I have a Premier DEH-P900R. I love that thing. I have never had an ounce of trouble with that thing, and I know very few who ever have. Check out Ebay for some subs, there are alot of discount business on there selling stereo equipment.||||reg||1
